  "content": "Vetra Studio (`ph vetra --watch`) is the primary builder tool. It provides automatic code generation from specification documents: add a document model spec to generate state schema and operations code, add an editor spec (linked to a document model) to generate `editors/<name>/editor.tsx`, add a Drive-app spec to generate Drive-app scaffolding. The `--interactive` flag prompts before generation. Vetra handles Tailwind CSS configuration, build processes, and live preview automatically. For manual control, `ph generate` is a subcommand group (not a flag-driven command): `ph generate editor --name <str> --document-type <str>`, `ph generate app --name <str> --document-types <value>` (the `app` subcommand replaced the old `--drive-editor`), `ph generate subgraph --name <str>`, and `ph generate processor --name <str> --type <str> --document-types <str>`. Connect (`ph connect`) provides a similar development environment.\n\n_Corrected 2026-08-13 against Powerhouse v6.2.2-dev.45._",
